# Wulfgar of Icewind Dale doubles only what a creature its controller controls attacking triggers (CR 603.2d): Bot2
# attacking Bot1 with an Elvish Mystic triggers Bot1's Emberwilde Captain ("Whenever an opponent attacks you while you're
# the monarch ...") once, for the seven cards in Bot2's hand. (Isshin, which says "a creature attacking", doubles it:
# isshin-doubles-emberwilde-for-an-opponents-attack-but-not-the-attackers-own-trigger.) The Captain's own enters
# ability, which no attack caused, triggers once too: Bot1 becomes the monarch.
# Turn 1: Wulfgar (Mountain, Black Lotus GGG, Mox Emerald). Turn 2: Bot2's Mystic. Turn 3: the Captain (two Mountains,
# Mox Ruby, Mox Jet). Turn 4: Bot2 (7 + 1 - 2 + 1 = 7 cards) attacks Bot1 with the Mystic, unblocked.

